Package: asharechips
Title: Estimate Holding Cost Distributions for Chinese Equities
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Ruihong", family = "Zhao", email = "3142115360@qq.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates holding-cost distributions of mainland Chinese
    A-share equities from daily price, volume, amount and turnover data.
    Implements the linear turnover-based cost-distribution recurrence of Liu
    and Wang (2018) <doi:10.1016/j.physa.2017.11.154>, and adds a package-specific
    exponential-retention alternative and price-allocation choices. Provides
    optional adjustment factors and initial distributions, offline preparation
    of 'Tushare' tables, weighted cost summaries and diagnostics for
    reproducible sensitivity analysis.
